<div class="banner-container section__borderless" id="homepageBanner">
    <div class="banner-text text-center">
        <h2>Singapore Rovers</h2>
        <h3 id="homepageBannerText">Be part of something great.</h3>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="container">
    <div class="section">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
                <h4>We are a community of youth, committed to furthering our development and that of like-minded individuals, with the vision of creating a Better World for all of us to live in.</h4>
                <h4>We seek plenty of excitement &amp; fun in our activities!</h4>
                <h4>With our roots firmly grounded in the Scouting Method, Rovers are part of a global network of young adults who seek to develop themselves through Adventure, Service &amp; Fellowship!</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-8 -->
        </div> <!-- /.row -->
    </div>
    <div class="section text-center">
        <div class="page-header"><h2>Upcoming Events</h2></div>
        {{> eventCardList upcoming}}
    </div>
    <div class="section">
        <div class="page-header text-center"><h2>Adventure <small>‘Life without adventure would be deadly dull’ | Lord Baden-Powell</small></h2></div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
                <h4>Some of us may crave the taste of adventure more than others, but we all need a little adventure in our lives. Rovers are encouraged to embark on adventures of their choosing, ranging from the simplest to the most challenging.</h4>
                <h4>Our Rovers take part in cool adventures such as scuba diving, kayaking, mountain biking and sailing, amongst others. And if none of these capture your interest, you’re encouraged to organize an adventure of your own &amp; we’ll support you as best we can!</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-8 -->
        </div> <!-- /.row -->
    </div>
    <div class="section">
        <div class="page-header text-center"><h2>Service <small>You have the power to change the world.</small></h2></div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
                <h4>Rovers do plenty of things to help those around us. Some of the projects we have include working with our brothers &amp; sisters who have special needs [Project Rigel] &amp; turtle conservation [Project Orion] amongst many others. Even if none of these appeal to you, there’s nothing stopping you from striking out to realize your ideas.</h4>
                <h4>Service isn't all about projects though. More importantly, each of us can make a difference to those around us, through how we interact with the people we meet.</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-8 -->
        </div> <!-- /.row -->
    </div>
    <div class="section">
        <div class="page-header text-center"><h2>Fellowship <small>Confused? So were we. At first.</small></h2></div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
                <h4>Rovering is about making new friends, bonding with old ones &amp; forming gut-busting friendships. As one Rover put it, our most lasting friendships are the ones where we suffer together &amp; enjoy together.</h4>
                <h4>And this is what Rovering is about. The adventures we share, the differences we make &amp; how all of this comes together.</h4>
            </div> <!-- /.col-md-8 -->
        </div> <!-- /.row -->

    </div>
</div>
